{"4255670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lumber in Space", "steam_appid": 4255670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing game about cutting weird types of trees in space. Whack space trees, collect drops, send them to space HUB and upgrade your gear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smack weird trees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find various types of weird trees, from mushroom to candy trees and much more. Each tree has unique drop, some rarer than others, challenge yourself, gather every possible drop  and sell them to get the ultimate gear!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade gear &amp; stats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from wooden spoon and working your way to many different axes and some secret gear. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new areas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area has a couple tree type each has unique drop, advancing to the next tier of trees require you to upgrade your gear.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing game about cutting weird types of trees in space. Whack space trees, collect drops, send them to space HUB and upgrade your gear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smack weird trees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find various types of weird trees, from mushroom to candy trees and much more. Each tree has unique drop, some rarer than others, challenge yourself, gather every possible drop  and sell them to get the ultimate gear!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade gear &amp; stats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from wooden spoon and working your way to many different axes and some secret gear. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new areas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area has a couple tree type each has unique drop, advancing to the next tier of trees require you to upgrade your gear.</p>", "short_description": "A relaxing game about cutting weird types of tree